@@ -35 +35,3 @@ The live unauthenticated metadata and MCP probe was blocked by Cloudflare error
 Self-hosted validation adds real SDK discovery and tool dispatch against an intercepted Docker fixture, real host stores and instance-driven public OAuth registration and PKCE exchange for web and desktop callbacks. Route, encrypted-store, request-selection and rendered UI tests cover both deployment choices, authentication validation, immutable saved bindings and coexistence with existing hosted credentials. No live self-hosted deployment or Cloudflare account was provisioned or contacted.
+
+`pnpm exec tsx scripts/openseo-browser-smoke.ts` bundles the real connection form and styles into a disposable browser fixture. It checks Hosted/API-key setup, switching to Docker without leaking the entered key, Cloudflare OAuth request selection and switching back to an empty hosted-key form at 1440px and 390px. It never opens a Ri Home or sends a connector request. Relevant host and engine suites, both typechecks and lint pass.
